# Cross-origin isolation, required by the p2p wasm module.
#
# flutter_rust_bridge runs Rust calls on web workers that share the wasm
# module's linear memory, so the module is built with a shared memory
# (tool/build_web.sh). A shared memory is a SharedArrayBuffer, and a browser
# only hands one out on a cross-origin isolated page. Without these two
# headers the module fails to instantiate and `RustLib.init()` throws.
#
# This is the Cloudflare Pages / Netlify `_headers` format. Flutter copies
# web/ into build/web/ verbatim, so it also lands in the same-origin bundle a
# Mydia instance serves at /player, where nothing reads it and it is inert.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
